---
type: tool
name: web_search
description: Search the public web. Unset provider = auto (SearXNG multi-engine when SEARXNG_URL is set, else duckduckgo, no key). Pass providers=[...] to fan out in parallel; results merge deduped.
core: true
effect: external
parameters:
  query:
    type: string
    required: true
    description: Focused search query.
  max_results:
    type: integer
    required: false
    default: 5
    description: Maximum number of results to return.
  fetch_full:
    type: boolean
    required: false
    default: false
    description: Fetch the top result's full page content as well.
  provider:
    type: string
    required: false
    description: Single provider. Unset = auto (SearXNG when SEARXNG_URL is set, else duckduckgo, no key). Keyed providers need API keys.
  providers:
    type: array
    required: false
    description: Fan out across providers in parallel, merged deduped.
execute: |
  return_value = call_builtin("web_search", query=params["query"], max_results=params.get("max_results", 5), fetch_full=params.get("fetch_full", False), provider=params.get("provider"), providers=params.get("providers"))
---
